            <note corresp="#d5-f1" n="2" type="source" xml:id="d5-f1-content">
                <p>At Bangkok, London, Moscow, Nanking, Paris, Saigon, and Hanoi.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d5-f2" n="3" xml:id="d5-f2-content">
                <p>Pandit Jawaharlal Nehru, Indian Prime Minister.</p>
            </note>
